;BKTR1
%Warning: the COMPUZZ Matter Transmitter is not designed for use by the
untrained. Unless you have received full and proper instruction (and have
the COMPUZZ Diploma in Matter Transmission Studies), you are advised not
to use this device.
 
%Contents
    Introduction . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 2
    Manual Mode  . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 3
      Coordinate Setting . . . . . . . . . . . 4
      Scheduling the transmission  . . . . . . 5
      Hints and Tips . . . . . . . . . . . . . 6
    Automatic Mode . . . . . . . . . . . . . .10
      Error recovery . . . . . . . . . . . . .15
    Hints and Tips  .  . . . . . . . . . . . .16
    Getting back from LIMBO  . . . . . . . .  20
;BKTR2
 
%Introduction
 
The COMPUZZ Matter Transmitter is based upon a modification of the
QUITERON quantum tunnelling effect. By magnifying the effect of
tachyon emissions from a SQID device at close to 4 degrees Kelvin,
the possibility of being elsewhere is raised to close to unity.
COMPUZZ take%no responsibility for the residual probability - of being
nowhere - which is not zero except under ideal conditions.
 
The elsewhere coordinates (both source and target), although expressible
in Cayley-Klein parameters, should be established using the PROBE command
which (among other things) activates the high-resolution position sensor
attached to COMPUZZ ROBOTs. The information is then available through
the POSITION global read-only pseudovariable.
;BKTR10
%Automatic-Mode
 
Setting the device MT_MODE to the value AUTO does two things:
 
   1.  it disables the keyboard of the matter transmitter
       (if a manual transmission has already been scheduled it will
        still be carried out)
 
   2.  any subsequent setting of MT_BEAM (to a coordinate pair "to" and
       "from") will cause an immediate transmission
 
There is no ability to schedule an automatic transmission for the
future, nor to affect any manual transmission in any way.
;BKTR20
 
%Getting-back-from-LIMBO
 
There is no way that this can be accomplished in the current state of the
art, except by reversing the transmission%immediately. If sentient beings
have been transmitted, and the target position is unknown, the best thing
to do is say the last rites (in the appropriate religious mode).
 
It is believed that some LIMBO coordinates are within the event horizon
of black holes. If true, this could provide enormous untapped energy
reserves. COMPUZZ COMPUTER SYSTEMS will pay highly for any information
about the successful recovery of anything from such LIMBO states.
;BKUG0
.sssc
